{"code":2000,"codename":"Koyuki","data":{"id":384,"skin":"泳装","skin_jp":"水着","skin_cn":"泳装","skin_zh_tw":"泳裝","skin_list":[{"id":33,"avatar":"//static.kivo.wiki/images/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/avatar.png","skin":"","skin_cn":""},{"id":384,"avatar":"//static.kivo.wiki/images/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/Student_Portrait_CH0268_Collection.png","skin":"泳装","skin_cn":"泳装"}],"family_name":"戒野","given_name":"美咲","family_name_jp":"戒野","given_name_jp":"ミサキ","family_name_kr":"이마시노","given_name_kr":"미사키","family_name_en":"Imashino","given_name_en":"Misaki","family_name_zh_tw":"戒野","given_name_zh_tw":"美咲","family_name_cn":"戒野","given_name_cn":"美咲","nick_name":"","momo_talk_signature":"稍微放晴一些的话，就好了呢……","main_relation":42,"relation":[5,14],"age":16,"grade":"二年生","height":163,"birthday":"01-13","hobby":"独处","designer":"Owa","illustrator":"dydldidl","character_voice":"土屋李央","character_voice_cn":"赵涵雨","release_date":"2025-09-03","release_date_cn":null,"release_date_global":null,"school":10,"weapon_type":"RL","is_install":true,"is_install_cn":false,"is_install_global":false,"is_npc":false,"show_list":true,"body_shape":"Medium","special_appearance":false,"spine":[782,1161],"model":[107,458],"voice":[{"description":"ch0268_cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"好无聊……。","text_original":"退屈……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_cafe_monolog_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"（嗯……那是什么？）","text_original":"（あれ……何？）","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_cafe_monolog_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"原来别人平常是这样度过时间的啊……。","text_original":"他の人は普段こう過ごしてるんだ……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_cafe_monolog_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_cafe_monolog_4","category":"cafe","text":"都说了我没兴趣啦……真的。","text_original":"だから、興味ないってば。……本当に。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_cafe_monolog_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_cafe_monolog_5","category":"cafe","text":"（老师……现在在做什么呢）","text_original":"（先生……何してるんだろ）","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_cafe_monolog_5.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_commonskill","category":"battle","text":"这、这个我只是顺手带来的……！","text_original":"こ、これは一応持ってきただけで……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_commonskill.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_eventlobby_1_1","category":"event","text":"干嘛？","text_original":"なに？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_eventlobby_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_eventlobby_1_2","category":"event","text":"不管老师怎么说，我都没打算享受这个。","text_original":"先生がなんと言おうと楽しむつもりはないよ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_eventlobby_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_eventlobby_2","category":"event","text":"（……比平时，好像更让人耳目一新）","text_original":"（……いつもより、新鮮かも）","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_eventlobby_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_eventlobby_3","category":"event","text":"干、干嘛？为什么戳我？我可不是玩偶……！","text_original":"な、なに？なんで突っついたの？私、ぬいぐるみじゃないんだけど……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_eventlobby_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_eventlobby_4_1","category":"event","text":"……很闲吗？去那边看看舞台不行吗？","text_original":"……暇なの？ステージでも見てきたら？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_eventlobby_4_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_eventlobby_4_2","category":"event","text":"我？没兴趣，不过……老师想去的话，","text_original":"私？興味ないけど……まあ、先生が行きたいなら。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_eventlobby_4_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_eventlobby_4_3","category":"event","text":"我陪你去就是了。","text_original":"付き合ってあげるよ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_eventlobby_4_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_eventlogin_1","category":"event","text":"啊，来了啊。唉……嘛，也算玩得还行啦。","text_original":"あ、来たんだ。あー……まあ、それなりに楽しんでるよ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_eventlogin_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_eventlogin_2","category":"event","text":"原来，大海就是这样的地方啊……。","text_original":"海って、こういうところなんだ……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_eventlogin_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_eventlogin_season_1_1","category":"event","text":"哈……真想安静地待着。","text_original":"はあ……静かに過ごしたい。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_eventlogin_season_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_eventlogin_season_1_2","category":"event","text":"老师，想点办法嘛。","text_original":"なんとかしてよ、先生。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_eventlogin_season_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_eventlogin_season_2","category":"event","text":"什么啊，这么多人……好像倒也没什么危险。","text_original":"何、この人混み……。危険はないみたいだけど。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_eventlogin_season_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_eventlogin_season_end","category":"event","text":"结束了吗……嗯，确实不算糟糕。我承认啦，就这一次。","text_original":"もう終わりなんだ……。……うん、たしかに悪くなかった。認めるよ。今回だけね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_eventlogin_season_end.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_exskill_1","category":"battle","text":"呼……啊！太好了……。","text_original":"ふう……。あっ！よかった……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_exskill_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_exskill_2","category":"battle","text":"这样就好……！哎！？呼……。","text_original":"これでよし……。っ！？ふぅ……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_exskill_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_exskill_3","category":"battle","text":"成功了……不行！还好，没事……。","text_original":"できた……。だめっ！無事だね……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_exskill_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_exskill_level_1","category":"battle","text":"玩水时间到。","text_original":"水遊びの時間。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_exskill_level_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_exskill_level_2","category":"battle","text":"水枪，发射。","text_original":"水鉄砲、発射。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_exskill_level_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_exskill_level_3","category":"battle","text":"淹没吧。","text_original":"溺れて。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_exskill_level_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_exweapon_get","category":"growup","text":"会在这种地方用到吗……。“武器也是有用处的”？唉……你这种话倒是说得聪明呢。我知道了……谢谢。","text_original":"こんなとこで使うかな……。「武器も使いよう」？はぁ……そういうとこ、口回るよね。わかった……ありがとう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_exweapon_get.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_formation_in_1","category":"formation","text":"海啊……没什么好玩的。","text_original":"海……あんまり楽しくない。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_formation_in_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_formation_in_2","category":"formation","text":"唉……你会负责的吧？","text_original":"はぁ……責任取ってくれるんだよね？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_formation_in_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_formation_select","category":"formation","text":"我知道了……玩就是了吧？","text_original":"分かった……遊べばいいんでしょ？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_formation_select.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_gachaget","category":"growup","text":"又热又黏……所以，现在要干嘛？","text_original":"暑いし、ベタベタする……。で、何するの？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_gachaget.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_growup_1","category":"growup","text":"我可不是在享受什么哦。既然是老师带我来的，那就负责让我玩得开心点。","text_original":"別に楽しんでるわけじゃないよ。先生が連れてきたんだから、責任とって楽しませてよね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_growup_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_growup_2","category":"growup","text":"把我变成这样的，不就是老师吗？……请好好负责到底。","text_original":"私をこんな風にしたのは先生でしょ。……ちゃんと最後まで面倒みて。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_growup_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_growup_3","category":"growup","text":"这种感觉，好像也不坏……。……不，忘了我刚才说的。","text_original":"こういうのも悪くないかな……。……嘘、忘れて。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_growup_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_growup_4","category":"growup","text":"你看什么看啊……都说了我没在享受。","text_original":"何じろじろ見てるの……？だから楽しんでないって。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_growup_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_lobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"对海感兴趣……？没啊。","text_original":"海に興味……？ないよ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_lobby_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_lobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"……水好多啊。虽然，不能喝。","text_original":"……水が、たくさんあったね。飲めなかったけど。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_lobby_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_lobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"海边的回忆……？那种事，随便啦。","text_original":"海の思い出……？別にいいでしょ、そんなこと。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_lobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_lobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"“很开心，下次再去吧”……？","text_original":"「楽しかったから、また行こう」……？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_lobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_lobby_2_3","category":"lobby","text":"别那么随便说这种话啦……。","text_original":"そういうこと軽々しく言って……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_lobby_2_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_lobby_2_4","category":"lobby","text":"……那，什么时候去？","text_original":"……で、いつ行くの？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_lobby_2_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_lobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"……我觉得这些都没意义。海也好，泳装也罢。","text_original":"……全部無駄なものだと思ってるよ。海も、水着もね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_lobby_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_lobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"……对老师来说，也不是全都没意义？","text_original":"……先生には全部無駄じゃない？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_lobby_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_lobby_3_3","category":"lobby","text":"都说了别说些奇怪的话啦……！","text_original":"だから、変なこと言わないでってば……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_lobby_3_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_lobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"……待在这里的话，就能随便喝到干净的水了呢。","text_original":"……ここにいたら、綺麗な水を好きなだけ飲めるんだね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_lobby_4_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_lobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"嗯……没什么。","text_original":"ううん、なんでもないよ……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_lobby_4_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_lobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"大家都玩得开心吗？我……？","text_original":"みんな、海は楽しめたのかな。私……？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_lobby_5_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_lobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"一点也不开心。真的一点都没有。","text_original":"楽しくなかったよ。これっぽっちも。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_lobby_5_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_login_1","category":"lobby","text":"又迟到了？唉……不过我也是刚到。","text_original":"また遅刻？はぁ……私も、今来たとこだけど。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_login_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_login_2","category":"lobby","text":"……我可不是在等你。那个……辛苦了。","text_original":"……待ってたわけじゃないから。その……お疲れ様。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_login_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_memoriallobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"嗯……。","text_original":"ん……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_memoriallobby_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_memoriallobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"再一点……这边也削一削……。","text_original":"もうちょっと……こっちも削って……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_memoriallobby_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_memoriallobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"在这里加根枝条……这个角度……。","text_original":"ここに枝を……この角度で……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_memoriallobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_memoriallobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"……嗯，这样应该可以了。","text_original":"……うん、これでいいかな。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_memoriallobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_memoriallobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"……咦？","text_original":"……あれ？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_memoriallobby_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_memoriallobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"我为什么会在堆沙堡……？","text_original":"なんで私、砂の城なんて作ってるの……？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_memoriallobby_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_memoriallobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"……啊！老师……！","text_original":"……っ！先生……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_memoriallobby_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_memoriallobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"你一开始就想让我变成这样吧……！","text_original":"最初からこうさせるつもりだったんじゃ……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_memoriallobby_5_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_memoriallobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"……我可一点都不开心！真的一点都没有！","text_original":"……全然、これっぽっちも、楽しんでないからね！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_memoriallobby_5_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_relationship_up_1","category":"growup","text":"見ないで。いや、照れてるわけじゃないから……！","text_original":"見ないで。いや、照れてるわけじゃないから……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_relationship_up_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_relationship_up_2","category":"growup","text":"わかったよ……もう。こういうのも、悪くないね……はい、言ったよ。","text_original":"わかったよ……もう。こういうのも、悪くないね……はい、言ったよ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_relationship_up_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_relationship_up_3","category":"growup","text":"明日が……本当に、こんな風に悪いものじゃないって言うなら……これからも、証明し続けて。","text_original":"明日が……本当に、こんな風に悪いものじゃないって言うなら……これからも、証明し続けて。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_relationship_up_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_relationship_up_4","category":"growup","text":"私をこんな風にしたのに……。責任取るつもりなんて、ないんでしょ。……「できることはなんでもやる」？じ、自分が何言ってるかわかってるの！？","text_original":"私をこんな風にしたのに……。責任取るつもりなんて、ないんでしょ。……「できることはなんでもやる」？じ、自分が何言ってるかわかってるの！？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_relationship_up_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_season_birthday_1","category":"lobby","text":"生与死都毫无意义，所以也没必要庆祝什么。","text_original":"生も死も、無意味。だから、祝う必要もないよ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_season_birthday_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_season_birthday_2","category":"lobby","text":"即使老师来祝我，也不会有什么改变……。","text_original":"先生が祝ってくれたとこで、何も……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_season_birthday_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_season_birthday_3","category":"lobby","text":"……。","text_original":"……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_season_birthday_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_season_birthday_4","category":"lobby","text":"……谢谢。","text_original":"……ありがと。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_season_birthday_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_season_birthday_player_1","category":"lobby","text":"那、那个……也没什么特别的意思啦……老师，有什么想要的吗？","text_original":"その……別に、深い意味はないんだけど……欲しいものって、ある？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_season_birthday_player_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_season_birthday_player_2","category":"lobby","text":"我、我只是随便问问而已啦！","text_original":"き、聞いてみただけだから！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_season_birthday_player_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_season_halloween_1","category":"lobby","text":"恶作剧和糖果的交易……有什么意义吗？","text_original":"いたずらとお菓子の交渉……。何の意味があるの？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_season_halloween_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_season_halloween_2","category":"lobby","text":"这是……糖？我又没恶作剧啊。","text_original":"これ、飴……？私、別にいたずらしてないけど。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_season_halloween_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_season_halloween_3","category":"lobby","text":"咦……今天不是那个节日吗？","text_original":"あれ……今日はそういう日じゃなかったっけ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_season_halloween_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_season_newyear_1","category":"lobby","text":"新的一年开始了呢。以前的我，大概会说又离死亡更近了一步吧……。","text_original":"新しい年が始まったね。昔の私なら、また死に近づいたって言ってたのかな……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_season_newyear_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_season_newyear_2","category":"lobby","text":"现在的我怎么看？","text_original":"今はどうなのか、って？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_season_newyear_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_season_newyear_3","category":"lobby","text":"为什么……要问这种事？","text_original":"なんで……そんなこと聞くの？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_season_newyear_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0268_season_xmas","category":"lobby","text":"这种气氛我还不太习惯……不过，大家都挺开心的呢。","text_original":"こういう雰囲気、まだ慣れないけど……。みんな、楽しそうだね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0268_season_xmas.ogg"},{"description":"CH0268_Title","category":"lobby","text":"蔚蓝，档案。","text_original":"ブルー、アーカイブ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%88%92%E9%87%8E%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/CH0268_Title.ogg"}],"voice_cn":[],"voice_kr":[],"gift_data":[{"id":131,"favorability":240},{"id":78,"favorability":60},{"id":68,"favorability":60},{"id":52,"favorability":40}],"furniture":[1747],"character_datas":[{"character_id":20049,"dev_name":"CH0268","combat_style":"default","type":"Dealer","attack_attribute":"Explosive","defensive_attributes":"Special","is_groupc_control":false,"team_position":"BACK","battlefield_position":"SPECIAL","rarity":3,"limited":false,"outdoor_adaptability":"B","indoor_adaptability":"S","street_adaptability":"D","favorite_equipment":0,"weapons":{"name":"圣徒猎人","name_cn":""}}],"info_declare_uuid":"f62bbe1b-d698-4f94-a379-6b516f3bf7a0","skill_declare_uuid":"51621e5a-ea89-4edc-90ff-4a16d60dbc99","supplementary_uuid":"4d798b77-2e1b-4ec7-925e-1f99a2260164","supplementary_declare_uuid":"3c44aa53-1b3d-487a-83c4-80073008de41","created_at":1721658954,"updated_at":1762436957},"message":"OK","success":true,"time":1768851167,"version":"1.0.0-beta.42"}